▸ front matter (2 lines)

█ mdtui Kitchen Sink
════════════════════════════════════════

A fast terminal markdown viewer with vim
keys, mouse support, no live reload,
highlights, emoji shortcodes 🚀 ✨, and
links. Jump to the tasks or open another
file.

▌ Contents
────────────────────────────────────────

• Text
• Tasks
• Code
• Tables
• Alerts
• Images
• Diagrams
• Math

▌ Text
────────────────────────────────────────

Paragraphs wrap to the window width.
Soft line breaks join lines; a trailing
backslash forces a hard
break. Inline code, bold, italic, both,
strike and autolinks like
https://example.com all work. Footnotes
too.[1]

▎ Block quotes render with a bar.
▎
▎ ▎ And they nest.

Lists

1. First
2. Second
   ◦ nested bullet
   ◦ another
     ▪ third level
3. Third

Term
  : Description lists are supported as
    well.

